<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 9 WICKETS IN FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT AUSTRALIA BY 9 WICKETS IN FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Australia by nine wickets on the fourth day of the first test at Edgbaston on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 118 and 477. England 478-9 declared and 119-1.</p>
</text>
